{"id":27390,"date":"2025-10-07T06:41:12","date_gmt":"2025-10-07T13:41:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/?p=27390"},"modified":"2025-10-07T06:41:16","modified_gmt":"2025-10-07T13:41:16","slug":"pr-argo-next","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/pr-argo-next\/","title":{"rendered":"Future-Proof Your XR Strategy: Launch of ARGO Next Program by DigiLens Enables the Shift from Any XR Device to the ARGO Platform"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"27390\" class=\"elementor elementor-27390\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-108251dc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"108251dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f50b4e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f50b4e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"535\" src=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/PR-Next-Altoura-Frontline-01-1024x535.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-27391\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/PR-Next-Altoura-Frontline-01-1024x535.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/PR-Next-Altoura-Frontline-01-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/PR-Next-Altoura-Frontline-01-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/PR-Next-Altoura-Frontline-01-1536x803.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/PR-Next-Altoura-Frontline-01-2048x1071.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f048d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4f048d5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Future-Proof Your XR Strategy: Launch of ARGO Next Program by DigiLens Enables the Shift from Any XR Device to the ARGO Platform<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-06892ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"06892ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Partnership with Altoura provides customers the ability to seamlessly transition from any XR device, like the discontinued Microsoft HoloLens, to the ARGO platform, while retaining their current Microsoft infrastructure<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-344ed80 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"344ed80\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43e63a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"43e63a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Sunnyvale, CA \u2013 October 7, 2025:<\/strong>\u00a0DigiLens Inc., a leader in next-generation waveguide display technology and extended reality (XR) smartglasses, has launched the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.digilens.com\/next\">ARGO Next<\/a> program, a critical step in future-proofing enterprise XR strategies as organizations everywhere face Microsoft HoloLens 2 end-of-life. In partnership with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.altoura.com\/migrate-dynamics-365-guides-hololens-altoura-frontline\">Altoura<\/a>, the newest member of the DigiSaaS marketplace and a leading AI-powered frontline platform, ARGO Next enables seamless migration from any XR device, such as HoloLens, to enterprise-ready smartglasses, DigiLens <a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/argo\/\">ARGO<\/a>\u2122, with full compatibility across existing Microsoft cloud infrastructure. Businesses can upskill their workforce with easy access to immersive SOPs, product manuals, and next-generation collaboration, bringing in a new era of productivity, training, and knowledge management.<\/p><p>&#8220;Microsoft pioneered an impressive frontline productivity transformation with HoloLens and their software solutions,\u201d said Jamie Fleming, Altoura CEO. \u201cAt Altoura, we\u2019re excited to see DigiLens step forward with ARGO\u2014bringing customers next-generation hardware that pairs seamlessly with Altoura Frontline to make the transition effortless. Together, we\u2019re ensuring that enterprises can continue to scale knowledge, empower their frontline workers, and accelerate productivity with future-ready technology.&#8221;<\/p><p><strong>ARGO Next: Providing HoloLens Customers a Path Forward<\/strong><\/p><p>With Microsoft pivoting away from mixed reality hardware and HoloLens 2 officially unsupported after December 31, 2027, organizations must urgently replace legacy hardware without sacrificing years of investment in XR training, operations, and integration. Through ARGO Next, DigiLens and Altoura deliver a direct, future-ready migration path, ensuring business continuity with a familiar, enhanced experience and expanded functionality. Altoura Frontline is the replacement solution for Microsoft Dynamics 365 Guides (Frontline Procedures) and Remote Assist (Frontline Remote Expert).<\/p><p><strong>Key Benefits<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Optimized for ARGO<\/strong>: Native hardware support for seamless migration<\/li><li><strong>Cross-device compatibility:<\/strong> Continue using current XR devices during migration with no disruption to daily workflows<\/li><li><strong>AI-powered authoring<\/strong>: Create and update SOPs in hours, not days, accelerating rollout<\/li><li><strong>Advanced collaboration<\/strong>: Leverage spatial 3D annotations, secure sharing, and desktop collaboration for remote and frontline teams<\/li><li><strong>Automated migration<\/strong>: Free, API-level integration for continuity<\/li><\/ul><p>\u201cWith the AR industry at a turning point, enterprise customers demand solutions that combine proven hardware with scalable, intuitive software, and our partnership with Altoura delivers exactly that,\u201d said Brian Hamilton, VP of Sales and Marketing at DigiLens. \u201cOur partnership with Altoura delivers exactly that \u2013\u00a0empowering organizations to migrate from HoloLens and deploy next-generation AR workflows. At DigiLens, we\u2019re focused on giving customers the confidence to protect their investments, modernize operations, and stay ahead in a fast-changing market. Together, we\u2019re setting a new standard for enterprise XR migration and productivity.\u201d<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1f94f1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d1f94f1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5383d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f5383d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">###<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f9e6b9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3f9e6b9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bbf2696 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bbf2696\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><strong>About DigiLens Inc.<br \/><\/strong>DigiLens is a leader in holographic waveguides used for XR displays. The company has developed a patented optical platform and photopolymer technology that deliver best-in-class solutions using a unique, low-cost contact-copy manufacturing process. DigiLens enables OEM partners to design and build XR-enabled devices for the global automobile, enterprise, consumer, avionics, and defense industries. Based in Sunnyvale, CA, DigiLens\u2019 investors include industry leaders like Samsung Electronics, Samsung Electro-Mechanics, Diamond Edge Ventures, the strategic investment arm of Mitsubishi Chemical Holdings Corporation, Alsop Louie Partners, Optimas Capital Management, 37 Interactive Entertainment, UDC Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Universal Display Corporation, Niantic, Inc., Sony Innovation Fund, Dolby Family Ventures, Continental AG, and more.<\/p><p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><em>Press Contact<\/em><br \/>Brian Hamilton<br \/><a href=\"mailto:brian.hamilton@DigiLens.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Brian.Hamilton@DigiLens.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b36c28a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b36c28a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4dfa788 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4dfa788\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>About Altoura Frontline<br \/><\/strong>Altoura Frontline empowers enterprises to enhance frontline productivity through their two core modules: Frontline Procedures and Frontline RemoteExpert. Frontline Remote Expert connects frontline workers with global specialists through on-call mixed reality annotations, file transfer, and desktop sharing\u2014reducing downtime and accelerating troubleshooting. Frontline Procedures, powered by AI authoring and AR-enabled delivery, seamlessly integrates into the physical workspace to help enterprises capture critical knowledge, transform SOPs into interactive step-by-step procedures, and deliver expert task guidance without development dependency. The platform supports on-the-job maintenance, repairs, and inspection workflows\u2014improving first-time-fix rates, reducing downtime, and ensuring consistent execution at scale. Altoura is a Microsoft Gold Partner and a recognized Mixed Reality Partner, with proven deployments across Fortune 500 enterprises.<\/p><p><em>Press Contact<br \/><\/em>Jamie Fleming<br \/>jamie@altoura.com<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Future-proof your enterprise XR strategy with DigiLens ARGO Next and Altoura. Effortlessly migrate from Microsoft HoloLens, maintain compatibility with the Microsoft cloud ecosystem, and unlock next-generation productivity, training, and remote collaboration.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":27391,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"clo